# afterhours.fi server sample requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client).
# Set @base and @admin, then click "Send Request" above any block.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api
@admin = change-me
@chain = 11155111
@buyer = 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000001
@token = 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000002

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Config: networks, contracts, tokens, epochs, quoter
GET {{base}}/config

### Market status (Binance RWA status proxy + epoch clock)
GET {{base}}/market-status

### Force-refresh market status
GET {{base}}/market-status?refresh=1

### Tokens on a chain with prices, vol and breach stats
GET {{base}}/tokens?chainId={{chain}}

### Quote by barrier: $1,000 notional, 3% floor
GET {{base}}/quote?chainId={{chain}}&buyer={{buyer}}&token={{token}}&notionalUsd=1000000000&barrierBps=300

### Quote by budget: tightest floor that costs <= 10bp this week
GET {{base}}/quote?chainId={{chain}}&buyer={{buyer}}&token={{token}}&notionalUsd=1000000000&budgetBps=10

### Quote that should be priced out (1% floor on a volatile name usually exceeds 2%)
GET {{base}}/quote?chainId={{chain}}&buyer={{buyer}}&token={{token}}&notionalUsd=1000000000&barrierBps=100

### Policies + stats for an address
GET {{base}}/policies/{{buyer}}?chainId={{chain}}

### Keeper pool
GET {{base}}/vault?chainId={{chain}}

### Backtest summary
GET {{base}}/stats

### Famous weekends (optional ?kind=crash|rally, ?ticker=SPY)
GET {{base}}/famous?kind=crash

### Learn page content
GET {{base}}/learn

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- admin (x-admin-secret) -----------------

### Admin status: store mode, indexer cursors, job clock, overrides, recent quotes
GET {{base}}/admin/status
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

### Push live prices to the oracle (setLastPrices); optional per-symbol override
POST {{base}}/admin/prices
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}}, "prices": { "NVDAB": 224.5 } }

### Demo override for a ticker's live price (null clears)
POST {{base}}/admin/overrides
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "ticker": "NVDA", "price": 210.0 }

### Friday: post closes for an epoch
POST {{base}}/admin/close/1759521600
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}} }

### Monday: post opens (allowFallback uses spot/last-known when stockInfo.price is still null)
POST {{base}}/admin/open/1759521600
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}}, "allowFallback": true }

### Void an epoch for a token (refunds its policies on settle)
POST {{base}}/admin/void
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}}, "token": "{{token}}", "epochId": 1759521600, "reason": "stock_split" }

### Settle everything settleable (optionally one epoch)
POST {{base}}/admin/settle
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}} }

### Open the next two epochs (owner-only on-chain; logs the contracts/ command if the quoter is not the owner)
POST {{base}}/admin/epochs
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}} }

### Reindex from scratch (optionally from a block)
POST {{base}}/admin/reindex
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}}, "fromBlock": 0 }

### Run one indexer pass now
POST {{base}}/admin/index
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

{ "chainId": {{chain}} }
